    "description": "What: two Veteran F-16s ('Viper 1', 'Viper 2') on CAP \u2014 the armed search over a 4 km arena, no bandit named \u2014 and two Veteran MiGs ('Fulcrum 1' on Viper 1, 'Fulcrum 2' on Viper 2) coming in from 8.5 km (all four start inside the arena's soft edge, so all four MERGE) (CE-10005, AC-13, R-10022). The F-16s' radars search; each picks an air contact, a wingman's bandit only when no other is left. Judge: each MiG is shot at by an F-16 (the picks are deconflicted), and a MiG is shot down inside 300 s."
